    <History>Known to many as the Fairy of Winds, Sekaia appears in many cultures as the spirit that brings forth Spring and chases away the Winter. She is connected to seeds and protects the young of both plants and animals, some legends even say she gives Hylian children Boomerangs to protect themselves with until they can wield bows and arrows. She is described as a very peaceful and friendly Fairy, to children anyway. Legends say she will never appear to adults, and if one happens to catch her off guard they will find themselves in serious peril.</History>
